    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n# \n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/79285884a535ccec8a5449db1a754f08.svg) ⟨28⟩\nakhila56⟨28⟩\n/\nswecha-telangana-asr-base-model⟨29⟩\nlike 0\n Automatic Speech Recognition ⟨30⟩ TensorBoard ⟨31⟩ Safetensors ⟨32⟩ Telugu ⟨33⟩ whisper ⟨34⟩ speech-to-text ⟨35⟩ telugu ⟨36⟩ asr ⟨37⟩ swecha ⟨38⟩ telangana ⟨39⟩\nLicense: apache-2.0\n Model card ⟨29⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨40⟩ Metrics Training metrics ⟨41⟩ Community ⟨42⟩\nCopy to bucket new\n  * Swecha Telangana ASR Base Model⟨43⟩\n    * Model Description⟨44⟩\n    * Base Model⟨45⟩\n    * Language⟨46⟩\n    * Training Dataset⟨47⟩\n    * Training Configuration⟨48⟩\n    * Intended Uses⟨49⟩\n    * Limitations⟨50⟩\n    * Evaluation Results⟨51⟩\n    * Citation⟨52⟩\n    * Author⟨53⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨43⟩ Swecha Telangana ASR Base Model \n##   ⟨44⟩ Model Description \nThe **Swecha Telangana ASR Base Model** is a fine-tuned Automatic Speech Recognition (ASR) model built on **OpenAI Whisper Small** for Telugu speech recognition.\nThis model has been fine-tuned using the **Mozilla Common Voice Scripted Speech 26.0 Telugu** dataset through the Mozilla AI Speech-to-Text Finetuning Blueprint.\n##   ⟨45⟩ Base Model \n  * openai/whisper-small\n\n\n##   ⟨46⟩ Language \n  * Telugu (te)\n\n\n##   ⟨47⟩ Training Dataset \n  * Mozilla Common Voice Scripted Speech 26.0 – Telugu\n  * License: CC0-1.0\n\n\n##   ⟨48⟩ Training Configuration   \n| Parameter  | Value  |  \n| --- | --- |  \n| Base Model  | Whisper Small  |  \n| Language  | Telugu  |  \n| Learning Rate  | 1e-5  |  \n| Batch Size  | 32  |  \n| Gradient Accumulation Steps  | 1  |  \n| Warmup Steps  | 50  |  \n| Max Steps  | 50  |  \n| Mixed Precision  | FP16  |  \n| Evaluation Metric  | Word Error Rate (WER)  |  \n##   ⟨49⟩ Intended Uses \n  * Telugu Speech Recognition\n  * Speech-to-Text Applications\n  * Voice Assistants\n  * Accessibility Tools\n  * Educational Applications\n  * Automatic Caption Generation\n  * Research in Indian Language ASR\n\n\n##   ⟨50⟩ Limitations \n  * Trained only on Mozilla Common Voice Telugu speech.\n  * Performance may decrease for:\n    * Noisy environments\n    * Code-mixed speech\n    * Unseen accents\n    * Domain-specific vocabulary\n\n\n##   ⟨51⟩ Evaluation Results   \n| Metric  | Before Fine-tuning  | After Fine-tuning  |  \n| --- | --- | --- |  \n| WER  | 211.71  | 75.92  |  \n| CER  | 174.02  | 46.38  |  \nThe fine-tuned model significantly improves Telugu speech recognition compared to the baseline Whisper Small model.\n##   ⟨52⟩ Citation \nIf you use this model, please cite:\n  * Mozilla Common Voice\n  * Mozilla AI Speech-to-Text Finetuning Blueprint\n  * OpenAI Whisper\n\n\n##   ⟨53⟩ Author \n**Akhila Vishwanath**\nHugging Face: <https://huggingface.co/akhila56> \n\nDownloads last month\n    46\nSafetensors⟨54⟩\nModel size\n0.2B params\nTensor type\nF32 \n·\nFiles info\nInference Providers NEW⟨55⟩\n Automatic Speech Recognition ⟨56⟩\nThis model isn't deployed by any Inference Provider. 🙋 Ask for provider support⟨57⟩\n##  Model tree for akhila56/swecha-telangana-asr-base-model ⟨58⟩\nBase model\nopenai/whisper-small⟨59⟩\nFinetuned\n(3648⟨60⟩)\nthis model\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨61⟩ Privacy⟨62⟩ About⟨63⟩ Careers⟨64⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\nInference providers allow you to run inference using different serverless providers.\n",
